            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "EZK.43.13+EZK.43.14+EZK.43.15+EZK.43.16+EZK.43.17"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Ezk 43:13-17",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "text": ".",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Maz’ acurisha igicaniro mu miringa; uburebure bgaco bgar’ amatambge mirongwibiri y’ ukuboko uciriye mu nkokora, n’ubgaguke bgaco bgari mirongwibiri nyene, uburebure bg’ igihagararo bgar’ amatambge cumi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.4.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.4.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 4:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "x",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "1KI.7.23+1KI.7.24+1KI.7.25+1KI.7.26"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "1 Abam 7:23-26",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "text": ".",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Maz’ akora igikarabiro citwa ikiyaga, akivugutiye mu nkero, ubgaguke bgaco, uhereye ku rubiga rw’uruhande rumwe ugashitsa ku rundi, bgar’ amatambge cumi y’ukuboko uciriye mu nkokora, bgarangana impande zose; uburebure bgaco bg’igihagararo bgar’ amatambge atanu; urubiga rwaco rwazengukwa n’umugozi w’amatambge mirongwitatu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.4.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.4.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 4:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Musi y’urubiga rwaco hari hakīkūjwe n’ibishushanyo vy’uturende,",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.4.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.4.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "f",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4:3",
              "type": "text"
            },
            {
              "text": "Mu Giheburayo handitswe Amapfizi, ariko rāba",
              "type": "text"
            },
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "1KI.7.24"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "1 Abam 7:24",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "text": ".",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " mw itambge rimwe hār’ icumi‐icumi, dukīkūje hirya no hino kur’ ico kiyaga; utwo turende",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.4.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.4.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "text": " twari dutondeshejwe mu mirongo ibiri, twāvugutiranywe na co kikiri mu nkero. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.4.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.4.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 4:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Cari giteretswe ku bishushanyo vy’ amapfizi cumi n’abiri; atatu yarāba i burārūko, yandi atatu yarāba i burengerazuba, yandi atatu yarāba i bumanuko, yandi atatu yarāba i burasirazuba; ico kiyaga cari giteretse kur’ ayo mapfizi, kandi yose yar’ ahānye imigongo. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.4.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.4.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 4:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Intimba yaco yangana n’ikiganza c’umuntu, kand’ umunwa waco war’ umeze nk’uw’ igikombe, canke nk’ishurwe ry’irebe; cuzuzwa n’imibindi ibihumbi bitatu.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.4.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.4.5"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
