        },
        {
          "text": "Yubakisha n’urugo rw’inyubakwa, ari ho hār’ ah’ abaherezi, bo n’urugo rw’intangāro, akoresha n’ inzugi zarwo; izo nzugi zarwo azomekakw imiringa.",
